@AcademicSystem_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Is the API running and connected to the database?
GET {{AcademicSystem_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Count unique students with at least one enrollment
GET {{AcademicSystem_Api_HostAddress}}/api/inscripciones/cantidad
Accept: application/json

### Randomly and evenly assign blank sections for a subject
POST {{AcademicSystem_Api_HostAddress}}/api/comisiones/asignacion-aleatoria-masiva
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materiaId": 1
}

